  "details": "I uploaded a new model, and the eye tracking works save for actually moving the eyes, then a hoodie I put on had borked colliders but worked fine on my last avatar.\nI thought this was a skill issue on my part so I didnt think much of it till I changed a texture on my previous avatar and reuploaded it to find the same issues now present, both of them.\nI had a third avatar I just started, its not even uploaded yet but the colliders broke in unity for that one.\nI said this in a discord server and was asked about the breaking in unity because its happened to others as well.\nRolling back didnt fix it, I am going to try a whole new project later today.",
